# System-side fixes for stock vendor services (the vendor image itself is stock).

# vendor.qlm-service (QTI limits manager) has no config for this SoC: it logs
# "Unknown target identified with soc id 618 ... service is exiting" and exits with
# status 0 about 40 s after every start. The vendor rc does not mark it oneshot, so
# init restarted it all day (~2000 times). Let it run once per boot and stay stopped.
on property:init.svc.vendor.qlm-service=restarting
    stop vendor.qlm-service
